<title>USA: Pet Food Warehouse Inc Q3 Nov 2 profit.</title>
<headline>Pet Food Warehouse Inc Q3 Nov 2 profit.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Unaudited; in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>			   Third Quarter Ended     Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>				 Nov 2,     Oct 28,   Nov 2,  Oct 28,</p>
<p>				  1996	   1995     1996     1995</p>
<p> Net sales		  $17,903	16,590  $49,806 $ 43,357</p>
