<p>  expenses			822	   895    2,463    2,818</p>
<p>   Operating income (loss)   15	 (580)	510  (2,619)</p>
<p> Income taxes		    --	    --	 --	 --</p>
<p> Net income (loss)	     60	 (502)	666  (2,302)</p>
<p>Net income (loss) per share</p>
<p>				   0.01	(0.05)     0.07   (0.25)</p>
